      "answer": "The approved live patch window for Verdant Bay is 2026-03-24 from 02:00 to 04:00 local time. The rollback procedure if validation checks fail is to use the command `orchestrator rollback --target ruleset=<prior_sha>`, which rehydrates the prior rules and replays the cache invalidation hook. After rollback, Verdant Bay is notified, an incident is opened for manual remediation, and any partial replays are reverted. Validation involves running 50 synthetic approval flows plus a sample of 50 in-flight approvals marked by the customer, and if any validation fails, the rollback is triggered automatically [art_fff67d92fe41].",
